<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK 2-WEEK REV REPO AVERAGE YIELD 14.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK 2-WEEK REV REPO AVERAGE YIELD 14.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Tuesday average and maximum yields in a two-week reverse repo operation to drain liquidity, was unchanged at 14.5 percent. All bids were accepted at that rate.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
